{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Bea prepares to become the 7th <strong>Starbug Trooper</strong>, the ceremony is interrupted by an attack.\u00a0<strong>The 4 Horseflies of the Apocalypse</strong>  return after years of absence. Bea must unite all the Starbug Troopers to put an end to the schemes of <strong>Lies, Famine, Plague, and Conquest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/SBT_Dialog_en.png?t=1750080317\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AN ORIGINAL BLEND OF GENRES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the adventures of Bea and the other Starbug Troopers in a humorous journey that mixes strategy and action. <strong>Outsmart your opponent</strong> by positioning your troops to your advantage and gain the upper hand. Or perhaps you'd prefer to <strong>outpace them</strong>, using your reflexes and agility to destroy all their ships.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A STRATEGY BASED ON SUPPORT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase your chances of victory in combat : position your troops relative to each other to <strong>gain greater support than your opponent</strong> and stack the odds in your favor during battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/ST_TourATour-min.gif?t=1750080317\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MINI SHIPS, MAXI COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore environments at the scale of an insect. Carve your way through tall grass, navigate upstream rivers, or delve into a mysterious cavern in search of your opponents, <strong>destroying their ships before they find you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/ST_PinkBattle-min.gif?t=1750080317\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RECRUIT YOUR TROOPS FROM 7 UNIQUE SHIP TYPES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Seven unique insect-ships are available</strong>. Fighter, healer, bomber... Each ship has its own role and unique abilities. It\u2019s up to you to recruit the right ships to lead you to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/Recruit.gif?t=1750080317\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An epic journey into the heart of the first green space opera.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3160110?t=1750080317","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3160110?t=1750080317","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/07cafdf039e65b3f3dcc5ae7bbbcbf77e58ea2e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750080317","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/07cafdf039e65b3f3dcc5ae7bbbcbf77e58ea2e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750080317","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3749180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Bea prepares to become the 7th <strong>Starbug Trooper</strong>, the ceremony is interrupted by an attack.\u00a0<strong>The 4 Horseflies of the Apocalypse</strong>  return after years of absence. Bea must unite all the Starbug Troopers to put an end to the schemes of <strong>Lies, Famine, Plague, and Conquest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/SBT_Dialog_en.png?t=1750080317\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AN ORIGINAL BLEND OF GENRES</h2><p class=\"bb_par